      {
        "position": 1,
        "title": "Exactly what I needed.",
        "text": "I used this as a way to socialize my ACD puppy, but not let him touch the floor in public areas (until his vaccine series was completed). Worked wonderfully to give me both hands free while shopping or whatever.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "May 3, 2026",
        "author": "Magickal Maven",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFHJOJZVF3L5ZD6JVQXMUGP7SYVQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/1f8f5b4a-c1ff-4218-885a-1cc23152d996._CR0%2C116%2C652%2C652_SX460_SX48_.jpg",
