      {
        "position": 5,
        "title": "Works great for lifting and carrying your dog",
        "text": "I got this sling so we could safely lift our Huskies in and out of our tornado shelter, which has a pretty steep ladder style stairway. This ended up being exactly what we needed. The sling fits our Huskies really well, and in our trial run it worked perfectly for lifting them in and out without a lot of struggle. What stood out most was how secure and supportive it felt. With something like this, that really matters because you want to feel confident that your dogs are supported well and not slipping around while you are carrying them. This did a great job of giving full support and made the whole process feel much safer and more manageable.I also like that it is practical to keep on hand for emergencies. It is one of those products you hope you never really need, but having it ready brings a lot of peace of mind. The quality also seems very good. It feels well made, sturdy, and like it can handle the weight and stress that comes with lifting larger dogs. This has been a really helpful purchase for our situation. It fits well, feels durable, and most importantly it worked exactly the way I needed it to when testing it with our Huskies. If you need a reliable way to lift and carry a larger dog in a situation where safety and support matter, this is a really solid option.",
